---
import Layout from "../../components/Layout.astro";
import { EMAIL, mailto } from "../../lib/contact";
---

<Layout title="Privacy and cookies" description="How Astral ARRA uses cookies and visitor statistics.">
  <article class="article-body prose prose-arra mx-auto max-w-[52rem]">
    <h1>Privacy and cookies</h1>

    <h2>Statistics without cookies</h2>
    <p>
      The site uses Vercel Web Analytics to count page visits. This service sets no cookies and collects no data
      that could identify you personally.
    </p>

    <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      If you click “Accept” in the cookie banner, Google Analytics 4 is switched on. It sets cookies
      (<code>_ga</code>, <code>_ga_*</code>) and collects aggregated information: which pages you read, which
      country and device you come from, and how you found the site. The data is kept for up to 14 months and is not
      used for advertising. Without your consent, Google Analytics is not loaded.
    </p>
    <p>
      You can change your choice at any time from the
      <button type="button" data-cookie-settings class="text-ice-200 underline hover:text-neon">“Cookies”</button>
      link at the bottom of every page.
    </p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      When you write to me at <a href={mailto()}>{EMAIL}</a>, I use your address and message only to reply to you.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
